    "heading": "6. Routing policy and per-user/model priority",
    "url": "router-specification.html#6-routing-policy-and-per-usermodel-priority",
    "text": "Routing is a pure function over an immutable policy snapshot plus bounded live state. It MUST be deterministic for equal inputs except for an explicitly configured weighted tie-breaker seeded by request_id. Administrative ordering is never inferred from map iteration order."
