    "group": "Operator guides",
    "heading": "Asking for a reasoning tier",
    "url": "using-the-router.html#asking-for-a-reasoning-tier",
    "text": "reasoning_effort (minimal, low, medium, high), or reasoning.effort in the Responses dialect. An unrecognised value is an error rather than a silent downgrade. This is an eligibility filter, not a hint: a tier no target declares yields no_eligible_target rather than a quietly cheaper answer."
